# App Store marketing artwork. Kept out of the repo deliberately: it is ~11 MB
# of PNGs against a <1 MB source tree, nothing in the build reads it, and this
# repo is public and cloned to build. Binary that might later want removing is
# exactly what cost us a history rewrite once already — adding it later is one
# commit, taking it back out is not. Master copies live with the other design
# sources outside the repo; AppStoreListing.md is the text that matters and is
# tracked.
AppStoreScreenshots/
